hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3720","It was narrated from Zaid bin Thabit that the Prophet said:\"'Umra (a gift given for life) belongs to the heir.\""
"3721","Abu Isma'il said:\"\"Yahya narrated to us that Abu Salamah narrated to him"
"3722","It was narrated from Zaid bin Thabit that the Prophet ruled that 'Umra (a gift given for life) belongs to the heir."
"3723","Bashir bin Nahik narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Prophet said:\"\"A lifelong gift ('Umra) is permissible"
"3724","It was narrated that Qatadah said:\"\"Sulaiman bin Hisham asked me about a lifelong gift. I said: 'Muhammad bin Sirin narrated that Shuraih said: \"\"The Prophet of Allah ruled that a lifelong gift is permissible.\"\"'\"\" Qatadah said: \"\"I said: 'And An-Nadr bin Anas narrated to me"
"3725","It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas that the Prophet said:\"Indeed 'Umra is permissible.\""
"3726","It was narrated from Tawus that the Messenger of Allah made 'Umra and Ruqba binding."
"3727","It was narrated that 'Abdur-Rahman bin 'Alqamah Ath-Thaqafi said:\"\"The delegation of Thaqif came to the Messenger of Allah"
"3728","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah said:\"\"I was thinking of not accepting gifts except from a Quraishi"
"3729","It was narrated from Anas that some meat was brought to the Messenger of Allah and he said:\"\"What is this?\"\" It was said: \"\"It was given in charity to Barirah.\"\" He said: \"\"It is charity for her and a gift for us"
"3730","It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"\"The oath by which the Messenger of Allah used to swear was: 'No"
"3731","It was narrated from Salim that his father said:\"\"The oath by which the Messenger of Allah used to swear was: 'No"
"3732","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah said:\"\"When Allah created Paradise and Hell"
"3733","It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears"
"3734","Yazid bin Ziyad bin Abi Al-Ja'd narrated from Habib bin Abi Thabit, who said:\"I heard Ibn 'Umar say: 'The Messenger of Allah forbade Ruqba and said: \"Whoever is given something on the basis of Ruqba, it belongs to him.\"'\""
"3735","Ibn Juraij said: \"Abu Az-Zubair informed me that he heard Jabir saying: 'The Messenger of Allah said: \"Whoever is given something on the basis of 'Umra it belongs to him for the rest of his life and after he dies.\"'\""
"3736","It was narrated from 'Umar that the Prophet said:\"\"Allah forbids you to swear by your forefathers.\"\" 'Umar said: \"\"By Allah"
"3737","Hisham narrated from Abu Az-Zubair, from Jabir, that the Messenger of Allah said:\"Hold on to your wealth and do not give it on the basis of 'Umra. For whoever is given something on the basis of 'Umra for the rest of his life, it belongs to him for the rest of his life and after his death.\""
"3738","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Do not swear by your fathers"
"3739","It was narrated that Thabit bin Ad-Dahhak said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears by a religion other than Islam"
"3740","Thabit bin Ad-Dahhak narrated that the Messenger of Allah said:\"\"Whoever swears by a religion other than Islam"
"3741","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Buraidah that his father said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever says: I have nothing to do with Islam"
"3742","(A different chain) from Al-Awza'i, from Az-Zuhri, from 'Urwah and Abu Salamah, from Jabir, who said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Umra (a lifelong gift) belongs to the one to whom it was given; it belongs to him and to his descendants, and is inherited by those who inherit from him.'\""
"3743","It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah that the Prophet said:\"\"Do not swear by your forefathers or by false gods (At-Tawaghit)"
"3744","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever among you swears and says: By Al-Lat"
"3745","It was narrated from Mus'ab bin Sa'd that his father said:\"\"We were talking about something"
"3746","Mus'ab bin Sa'd narrated that his father said:\"\"I swore by Al-Lat and Al-'Uzza and my companions said to me: 'What a bad thing you have said! You have said something horrible.' So I went to the Messenger of Allah and told him about that. He said: 'Say: La ilaha illallah wahdahu la sharika lah"
"3747","Al-Bara' bin 'Azib said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah commanded us to do seven things: He commanded us to attend funerals"
"3748","It was narrated from Abu Musa that the Prophet said:\"\"There is nothing on Earth that I swear an oath upon"
"3749","It was narrated that Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari said:\"\"I came to the Messenger of Allah with a group of the Ash'ari people and asked him to give us animals to ride. He said: 'By Allah"
"3750","Hisham said:\"Yahya bin Abi Kathir narrated to us, he said: 'Abu Salamah bin 'Abdur-Rahman narrated to me, he said: \"I heard Jabir say: 'The Messenger of Allah said: \"A lifelong gift belongs to the one to whom it was given.\"'\"'\""
"3751","It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah that the Messenger of Allah said:\"\"If any one of you swears an oath"
"3752","Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'If you swear an oath"
"3753","It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah that the Prophet said:\"\"If you swear an oath"
"3754","It was narrated that 'Adiyy bin Hatim said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears an oath"
"3755","It was narrated that 'Adiyy bin Hatim said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears an oath"
"3756","It was narrated that 'Adiyy bin Hatim said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears an oath"
"3757","It was narrated from Abu Al-Ahwas that his father said:\"\"I said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"3758","It was narrated that 'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah said:\"\"The Prophet said to me: 'If you swear an oath"
"3759","Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'If you swear an oath"
"3760","Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah said:\"\"The Messenger of Allah said to me: 'If you swear an oath"
